pinned_by = "Direct @cosmjs/crypto@0.32.4 -> elliptic@6.6.1 (range ^6.5.4). Direct @cosmjs/amino@0.32.4, @cosmjs/cosmwasm-stargate@0.32.4, @cosmjs/proto-signing@0.32.4 and @cosmjs/tendermint-rpc@0.32.4 each -> @cosmjs/crypto@0.32.4 -> elliptic@6.6.1; direct @cosmjs/stargate@0.32.4 -> @cosmjs/amino@0.32.4 -> @cosmjs/crypto@0.32.4 -> elliptic@6.6.1. The 0.34.0 release line of these direct CosmJS packages removes these paths: @cosmjs/crypto@0.34.0 replaces elliptic with @noble/curves; the current ^0.32.4 constraints exclude them. Direct @pax-js/cosmos@1.0.6-pax.1 -> @cosmjs/proto-signing@0.32.4 (range ^0.32.4) -> @cosmjs/crypto@0.32.4 -> elliptic@6.6.1, also through @cosmjs/stargate@^0.32.4; no replacement release of @pax-js/cosmos removing this path was identified. Direct hardhat@2.28.6 -> @ethersproject/abi@5.8.0 -> @ethersproject/hash@5.8.0 -> @ethersproject/abstract-signer@5.8.0 -> @ethersproject/abstract-provider@5.8.0 -> @ethersproject/transactions@5.8.0 -> @ethersproject/signing-key@5.8.0 -> elliptic@6.6.1 (exact 6.6.1); hardhat@3.0.0 removes this ethers v5 dependency chain and is excluded by ^2.22.10. Direct @nomicfoundation/hardhat-toolbox@5.0.0 -> peer hardhat-gas-reporter@1.0.10 -> eth-gas-reporter@0.2.27 -> ethers@5.8.0 -> @ethersproject/signing-key@5.8.0 -> elliptic@6.6.1; toolbox@5.0.0 also -> peer @nomicfoundation/hardhat-network-helpers@1.1.2 -> ethereumjs-util@7.1.5 -> ethereum-cryptography@0.1.3 -> secp256k1@4.0.4 -> elliptic@6.6.1 (range ^6.5.7), and requires Hardhat 2 as a peer. Toolbox@6.1.0 retains Hardhat 2 and network-helpers@^1.1.0; toolbox@7.0.0 removes dependency and peer declarations but explicitly does not work with Hardhat 2 or 3. Network-helpers@3.0.0 removes ethereumjs-util and requires Hardhat ^3.0.0. Removing elliptic requires addressing all independent dependency paths; the advisory names no patched elliptic version."
revision = "acb0ede973ea7d56086f9026bd71bd4d78145ae9"
